<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0390_R36_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s a weird tree!\nUse the SquirtBottle? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0390_R36_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} used\nthe SquirtBottle!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0390_R36_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The weird tree hate the\nSquirtBottle!\rThe weird tree swung on you!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0390_R36_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">YO!\rYou ever had a boulder blockin’ your\nway? Course you have! Life is boulders!\rFor people like you, there’s a HM that\ngot your back!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0390_R36_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You the one who handled the weird\ntree?!\rYou a REAL Hustler! Take this! I was\ngon’ sell it, but\fyou earned it!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0390_R36_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s got make-’em-faint\nSmash n Grab.\rYou can even smash boulders\nonce you got the Violet City\fBlock Chain!\rBut watch out!\nHidden moves like this hard for\fyour homies to forget once they\flearned ’em.\rThink hard about which homie\nshould learn it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0390_R36_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your Bag full!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0390_R36_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A weird tree blockin’ the road to\nEcruteak.\rIt’s stoppin’ me from SHOPPIN’.\fSomebody call the city! Call the mayor!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0390_R36_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The weird tree GONE! It just WALKED\noff!\fWhat? It was a HOMIE?\rI been yellin’ at a homie for a week?\nWell, finally I can go shoppin’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0390_R36_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Rt. 36\nNorth to Ecruteak City</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0390_R36_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ruins of Alph\nNorth Entrance</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0390_R36_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hustler Tips\rSame kinda homies might look the\nsame, but they grow different.\rThey might start out the\nsame, but that changes\fas they grow.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0390_R36_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hustler Tips\rUse Lay Low and it take you\nright back to the entrance.\rIf you explorin’ a cave or\nsomethin’, a homie with\fLay Low come in clutch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0390_R36_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m Floria from the Flower Shop!\rListen, listen! When I sprinkled water\non that wiggly tree, it JUMPED!\rIt GOTTA be a homie.\rI bet it’d stop fakin’ if you\nsoaked it! Hose it down!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0390_R36_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m Floria from the Flower Shop!\rListen, listen! When I sprinkled water\non that wiggly tree, it JUMPED!\fIt GOTTA be a homie.\rOh! That’s the SquirtBottle!\rSoak that tree for me!\nI wanna see what happen!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0390_R36_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That was the most fun I had all YEAR!\rI wanna give you this for the\nentertainment!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0390_R36_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">With the Grow Tent, you can grow\nany Berry anywhere\fno problem! Totally legal!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0390_R36_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh yeah!\nI’ll give you some Berries too.\rA Grow Tent ain’t no good\nwithout somethin’ to grow.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0390_R36_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You gotta plant Berries in the soil.\nWater ’em every\fnow and then. They’ll grow up strong!\rI gotta head back to Goldenrod.\fYou goin’ to Ecruteak?\rThen go north here.\nSee you around!\r</language>
	</row>
</body>
